    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this attractive 3 bedroom log cabin situated within the popular Drumcoura Lake Resort, positioned directly opposite the lake and set in a peaceful countryside location close to Ballinamore.\n\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation comprising a welcoming entrance hallway, living room with patio doors, kitchen/dining room, utility room, shower room and three bedrooms, including one ensuite, together with a mezzanine at first floor level.\n\nThe property benefits from Gas Fired Central Heating (GFCH), mains water, mains sewage and PVC double glazed windows. Set within approximately 0.11 hectares (0.27 acres), the property offers an excellent opportunity as a holiday home or investment property.\n\nDrumcoura Lake Resort offers a range of recreational facilities and provides an attractive base for enjoying the surrounding lakes and countryside.\n\nViewing Strictly by Appointment Only with Sole Selling Agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
