        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\n\nLiving Room (Patio Doors)\n\nKitchen/Dining Room\n\nUtility Room\n\nShower Room\n\n3 Bedrooms (1 Ensuite)\n\nMezzanine (First Floor Level)"
      },
