        "Content": "Attractive 3 Bedroom Log Cabin\nPopular Drumcoura Lake Resort Location\nPositioned Directly Opposite the Lake\n3 Bedrooms (1 Ensuite)\nMezzanine at First Floor Level\nLiving Room with Patio Doors\nGas Fired Central Heating (GFCH)\nMains Water & Mains Sewage\nExcellent Holiday Home or Investment Opportunity\nManagement Fees Approximately 1,500 Per Annum which includes access to onsite recreational facilities \nBuild year 2005"
